  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sandeep Kumar vs State Of Haryana And Another on 20 April, 2024 Neutral Citation No:=2024:PHHC:053347 N.C. No.2024:PHHC:053347 In The High Court Of Punjab & Haryana At Chandigarh 227 Crm-M-40237-2023 (O&M) Date of decision: 20.04.2024 Sandeep Kumar ....Petitioner(s) Versus State Of Haryana And Another ...Respondent(s) Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Sanjiv Berry",
    "facts": "The present petition has been preferred by the petitioner under Section 482 CrPC seeking direction to learned trial Court for deciding the application dated 20.02.2023 (Annexure P-4) filed by the petitioner in Complaint Case No.COMA/773/2021 dated 13.08.2021 titled as 'State through Food Safety Officer versus Sandeep Kumar'. 2.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that he has only limited prayer in the instant petition to the effect that the petitioner had moved an application dated 20.02.2023 (Annexure P-4) in the Court of learned Chief Judicial Magistrate, Ambala in Criminal Complaint No. COMA/773/2021 but till date the same has not been decided and the next date of hearing is 23.04.2024."
  },
